    "Spacecraft",
    "Legends"
  ],
  "strategy": "Jean-Luc Picard, Luminary draws a card whenever a historic permanent with mana value 3 or more enters under your control, and its Seek out puts a +1/+1 counter on another creature and two charge counters on a Spacecraft each time you draw your second card in a turn. That second draw is the deck's engine: Beverly Crusher, Chief Miles O'Brien, Data, Dr. Pulaski, Julian Bashir, Reg Barclay, Ro Laren, Rom and Leeta, Tom Paris, Vic Fontaine and Worf all trigger on it, and Howling Mine, Fevered Visions, Commander William Riker, Loran of the Third Path, Faithful Mending, Frantic Search and Thrill of Possibility make sure it comes every turn. The crew taps to station the U.S.S. Defiant, Enterprise-C, Enterprise-E, Prometheus and Stargazer until they become artifact creatures, Geordi La Forge slips through while you control a Spacecraft, and Tom Paris turns a second draw into a flying, double-striking alpha strike. Swords to Plowshares, Pongify, Abrade, Cryptic Command, Negate and Supreme Verdict keep the table honest.",
